<title>LATVIA: UNIBANKA SLIDES AFTER SHARE SALE NEWS.</title>
<headline>UNIBANKA SLIDES AFTER SHARE SALE NEWS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading bank Unibanka slid at the</p>
<p>bourse price fixing after news the privatisation agency is to</p>
<p>sell one million Unibanka shares at a minimum 3.05 lats.</p>
<p>Unibanka was down to 3.25 lats from 3.36 lats.</p>
<p>Shares can be bought (B) or sold (S) at the following prices</p>
<p>and in the following volume, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
